%% Title: Batch Aggregate Seal Write Commit Failure Lifecycle
%% @version 1.0.0
%% @date    2026-05-12
%% @type    stateDiagram
%% @level   Domain / Aggregate
%% RULES: RULES.md §2.1, ADR-021
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OPEN
    OPEN --> OPEN: add_record()
    OPEN --> SEALED: seal()
    SEALED --> WRITING: mark_writing()
    WRITING --> COMMITTED: commit()
    WRITING --> FAILED: mark_failed()
    COMMITTED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]

    note right of OPEN
      Batch intake remains mutable until the aggregate is sealed.
    end note

    note right of WRITING
      After mark_writing(), publisher paths should not mutate logical batch content.
    end note
